    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A two player, one keyboard competitive and cooperative\u00a0platform game for all ages</strong>, inspired by western cartoons and couch co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMP &amp; OAF</strong> are two amateur martial artists, fighting their way through a wacky city to find their missing sensei, Master Cheese. Help them traverse varied locations, talk to interesting characters, and learn a lesson about teamwork.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/13b85d0fae43c11b666f945fe42372e6.poster.avif?t=1750559418\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/13b85d0fae43c11b666f945fe42372e6.webm?t=1750559418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/13b85d0fae43c11b666f945fe42372e6.mp4?t=1750559418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>FEATURING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mischievous Fun -</strong></u> Hop, float, and most of all kick your way across 3 distinct locations and 10 different levels. Fight over coins but work together to reach the end!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A Humorous Tone -</strong></u> Enjoy plenty of visual novel styled story cutscenes full of cartoonish personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unique Controls -</strong></u>\u00a0No need for two devices! Squeeze in close and share one keyboard <strong>or</strong>\u00a0one controller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/5a0c8c3f7d8ad0546ae7495b6e66338b.poster.avif?t=1750559418\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/5a0c8c3f7d8ad0546ae7495b6e66338b.webm?t=1750559418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673920/extras/5a0c8c3f7d8ad0546ae7495b6e66338b.mp4?t=1750559418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now get in there and\u00a0KICK OFF!</strong></h2>",
